      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow5:220",
        "answer": "Builds CoD.SpawnRegionName from the supplied eight layout bounds; f1_arg0 is the menu and f1_arg1 the controller. Creates/adds/publishes children in source order: DangerBacking, DangerText, TimerBacking, HardpointTimer, SpawnBeaconIcon. Exact eager setup, property/asset values, each owned callback, guard and return are retained in the ordered source trace. Builds danger/timer/beacon visuals and configures HardpointTimer with setupBombTimer(0,true). It does not establish the bomb-timer provider, beacon lifecycle or spawn decision. Calls the shown optional load hook at its exact source position, then returns self. Child/base/provider lifetime and callback invocation remain conditional.",
